docs {
Setujui komentar (09-api-comment.md) - SATU-SATUNYA jalur ke published
(tampil publik). HANYA verifikator: admin/root/reviewer. Pakai comment_id
dari request Create Comment.

200 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "id": "01J...",
        "status": "published",
        "reviewed_by": "01J...",
        "reviewed_at": "2026-09-18T11:00:00.000Z"
      }
    }

409 komentar sudah punya keputusan (approve/reject sebelumnya - race dua
moderator klik bersamaan: satu 200, satu 409); 404 tidak ditemukan;
403 bukan verifikator.

Audit trail mencatat action "approve" (Section 21). Setelah approve,
komentar muncul di GET /words/:wordId/comments.
}

meta {
  name: Approve Comment
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/comments/{{comment_id}}/approve
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

tests {
  test("200 + published + reviewed_by terisi", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.status).to.equal("published");
    expect(res.body.data.reviewed_by).to.be.a("string").and.not.empty;
  });
}
